   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "白色挂杆，白色搁板，上面摆放着储物盒，下面是一条白色长凳。",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/ea/7d/ea7d84f79b3975ad970698e970dd9524.jpg"
